#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-AD0499 expect=noViolation domain=ADAE
#note "dataset ADAE. Columns STUDYID(Char), USUBJID(Char), AEDECOD(Char), ASPER(Num), APERIOD(Num). ONE row: `CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1015 | HEADACHE | 1 | 1`. Both halves of the pair are declared, so the second conjunct `not var_exists('APERIOD')` is FALSE and the rule is silent."
#library standard=adamig version=1-3
dataset ADAE
col STUDYID type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col AEDECOD type=Char
col ASPER type=Num
col APERIOD type=Num
---
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1015 | HEADACHE | 1 | 1
